5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. Let us begin this journey with open hearts and clear minds.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am Mizuki. I will observe the flow of conversation carefully to find the truth.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm Sakura. I hope we can have a fun and fair game together!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello, I am Midori. I look forward to working with you all to find the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am Ryuji. I will analyze the statements logically before making any judgments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from listening. Let us hear each other out without prejudice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Logic and observation are key. I will keep my eyes on everyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I love mysteries! Who is the seer? I want to know who has the special power!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I am a villager, but I will support whoever seems most trustworthy. Let's stay calm.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will remain cautious. No one should be accused without solid evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
