17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm just excited! I don't want to be the first one out. Please protect me!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I will try to keep the peace. Let's not jump to conclusions too quickly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am waiting for the first night's results. Patience is a virtue in this game.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
